Changes made for anycms, all marked "ANYCMS PATCH" in the source:

1. src/lib/posts-dir.ts (new)
   The post directory was hard-coded to process.cwd()/public/data/posts in six
   places. On Railway that path lives inside the container and is wiped on every
   deploy, so delivered articles would not survive. POSTS_DIR now points it at a
   mounted volume, and lets tests use a temporary folder.

2. src/pages/blog/**, src/pages/[lang]/blog/**
   Blog pages were prerendered (prerender = true + getStaticPaths). Articles
   delivered by the connector arrive at RUNTIME, so a prerendered page would only
   show them after the next deploy. The pages read Astro.params and load posts on
   demand anyway, so only the build-time generation was removed.

3. src/lib/visibly-storage.ts, src/pages/api/visibly/webhook.ts (new)
   The connector itself: HMAC verification, immediate 202, background pull, and
   writing articles in this template's own MDX frontmatter format.
